    "insert": "\nThis expose is on the topic of classifying skin cancer images using GANs with Dreambooth to mitigate the issue of not being able to finetune diffusion models. The student aims to categorize images of the three types of cancer: basal cell carcinoma, squamous cell carcinoma and melanoma, and cancer free images.\n\n"
