  },
  {
    "insert": "\nMotivation: This expose could benefit from clearly stating what its research questions are. While ‘classifying skin cancer images’ is clear throughout the expose, how physical characteristics such as skin color, age and sex affect the reliability of an ML solution is not given the same attention."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "SOTA: the literature cited here does not inform the reader what its relevance is to the author’s methodology. When citing previous works, you have to ask “What can i build on top of in this work? How does this benefit my interests?” instead of only stating what they have done."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "Methodology: could benefit from mentioning potential setbacks as it lets the reader know you are confident in your study and have thorough understanding of your topic."
